WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:06.710
For 13 years I circled Saturn.

2
00:00:07.410 --> 00:00:11.980
I carried the Huygens probe, which landed on the moon Titan.

3
00:00:12.680 --> 00:00:16.750
I saw geysers of ice shooting from tiny Enceladus.

4
00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:28.470
When my fuel ran low, I dived between Saturn and its rings 22 times, then plunged into the planet, sending data until the very last second.

5
00:00:29.170 --> 00:00:32.770
I sent you data until the very last second.
